BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Unraveling the Algorithm
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261125T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261125T210000
UID:evt-7kE6gyK83VKgf3l@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\n83 Walnut Ave\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nAs a collecti
 ve\, we will weave with our fingers to unravel the computer through its te
 xtile origins. As we fuss and fumble with our crafty creations\, we will r
 eflect on the design\, the algorithms and the power we have to change them
 .\nThe technologies we use every day are often black boxes: hidden behind 
 screens\, written in non-human languages\, and trained on vast amounts of 
 unattributed data. As these intangible\, alien systems quietly shape the w
 orld around us\, it becomes increasingly difficult to imagine technology a
